      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "class student:\n    school = \"regex\"\n    def __init__(self,name,age):\n        self.name = name\n        self.age = age\n\n    def display(self):\n        print(\"this students school=\", self.school)\n\no1 = student(\"mohit\",25)\no1.display()\n\n    ",
